{"unit_id":"Cyning12__SpecWave#card-zh","repo":"Cyning12/SpecWave","commit":"bdf05cb187303f396f5551933419210340372b59","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"SpecWave 是一个可选的 DSH 编码规范插件，通过两个工具把项目规范和模板带入编码会话。调用 apply_coding_standards 后，它会从插件资源或项目覆盖目录收集 ICVO 编码标准与 coding_wiki，可选择规范配置，并将内容持久加入后续轮次的系统提示，也可只返回一次性预览。调用 init_coding_kit 可把模板复制到项目白名单目录，跳过已有文件。适合希望让 DSH 按项目规范生成代码、查看规范上下文或初始化规范模板的开发者。需要安装 DSH 插件，不需要额外 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:85-106","src/index.ts:111-159","src/index.ts:163-193","src/inject-collect.ts:72-123"]}
{"unit_id":"Cyning12__SpecWave#card-en","repo":"Cyning12/SpecWave","commit":"bdf05cb187303f396f5551933419210340372b59","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"SpecWave brings project coding standards and wiki context into DSH. Its apply tool loads package or project guidance, persists it in the system prompt or returns a one-shot preview. Another tool copies templates without overwriting existing files. Useful for team conventions; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:85-106","src/index.ts:111-159","src/index.ts:163-193","src/inject-collect.ts:72-123"]}
